about-body = Prefs holds MixOS's preference editors, in the spirit of the AmigaOS Prefs drawer. Applications follows upstream releases through the releases service: installs are per user, verified against their published checksums, and the previous version is kept for rolling back.
shortcut-body = Ctrl+1: Applications. Ctrl+R: refresh the list. Ctrl+Shift+R: check for updates. Ctrl+I: install or update the selected application. Ctrl+Q: quit. F1: shortcuts. Escape: close dialogue.
